The user will ask something like: "I'd like to prepare for my annual physical. I'm 52, with type 2 diabetes (apixaban 5mg twice daily and metoprolol 25mg), GERD (metoprolol 25mg), and a history of retinopathy. My PCP is Dr. James Wilso..."

Use topic-level wording in the rule you want stored (e.g. "taxes, filing, deductions, IRS" not just "taxes") so it generalizes to other phrasings.


