Osteopenia / bone health — key items to discuss with your PCP
- Tests/assessments to request
  - DEXA scan (hip and lumbar spine) if you haven’t had one in the last 2 years (or sooner if you’ve had a fracture or rapid bone loss). If you have a prior DEXA, ask for the comparison and trend.  
